> I have a blessed +1 katana, Mjollnir (found) and Sting (named) and I have a   
> few enchant weapon scrolls which I would like to use up.  Just one problem 
> though, I don't what to push say the katana up to +5 or +7 and then have it go
> and rust.  How can I rustproof my weapons.  I've tried using a can of grease, 
> but all I get is a greased weapon !
> 
Greased weapon is rustproof - the problem is, that the rustproofing
will eventually go away, when the grease washes out...  Still it is
good on the short term. For permanent rustproofing there is a well known 
way, which I'll nevertheless mark with spoiler alert

Reading enchant weapon scroll while confused will rustproof the 
weapon instead of enchanting it. 

